---

# 23. Rate Limiting

| User          | Limit               |
| ------------- | ------------------- |
| Anonymous     | 60 requests/minute  |
| Authenticated | 300 requests/minute |

---

# 24. Logging

Log:

* Request ID
* Endpoint
* User
* Response code
* Duration

Never log:

* Passwords
* JWTs
* Secrets

---

# 25. OpenAPI

The complete API should ultimately be defined using an OpenAPI specification.

The OpenAPI document becomes the authoritative machine-readable contract for documentation, SDK generation and testing.

---

# API Principle

> **The API represents the Waypoint domain, never the database.**

